root ::= "{" ws "\"reasoning\"" ws ":" ws string ws "," ws "\"emotion\"" ws ":" ws emotion ws "," ws "\"intent\"" ws ":" ws intent ws "," ws "\"inner_monologue\"" ws ":" ws string ws "," ws "\"speech\"" ws ":" ws nullable-string ws "," ws "\"speech_volume\"" ws ":" ws speech-volume ws "}"

# 推理鷹架實驗（2026-08-09）：在turn_duration_experiment.gbnf.template基礎上，
# 新增一個「reasoning」欄位，放在intent之前——grammar硬約束逐token生成，
# 欄位順序=生成順序，原本intent排在inner_monologue前面，代表模型是先憑直覺
# 選好動作、獨白只是事後補的台詞。這次故意讓它被迫先寫一段「現在最大的問題
